gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text16d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text16d1=§9이름:§0 카급 <br>§9함급:§0 Submarine<br>§9공장:§0 심해 분출공 / Ammo (140)<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>소유자에게 Invisibility 효과 부여<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Pick up items<br>+"Invisibility"<br>SS base dodge 20%%<br><br>She is very indoorsy although she looks to be a "bad girl".
