gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text17d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text17d1=§9이름:§0 요급 <br>§9함급:§0 Submarine<br>§9공장:§0 심해 분출공 / Ammo (160)<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>소유자에게 Invisibility 효과 부여<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Pick up items<br>+"Invisibility"<br>SS base dodge 20%%<br><br>A shy shinkeiseikan, but be careful, it's difficult to break free once bitten.
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.title18=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text18d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text18d1=§9이름:§0 소급 <br>§9함급:§0 Submarine<br>§9공장:§0 심해 분출공 / Ammo (180)<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>소유자에게 Invisibility 효과 부여<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Pick up items<br>+"Invisibility"<br>SS base dodge 25%%<br><br>Likes swimming naked and hiting enemies with large and bulky torpedos.
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.title19=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text19d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text19d1=§9이름:§0 공모서희<br>§9함급:§0 서희급 CV<br>§9공장:§0 열수 소용돌이 / Polymetal (3000)<br>§9AuraEffect§0<br>+"Jump Boost" to nearby ships<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Enhanced melee attack<br><br>Melee: deal 100%% firepower AoE damage.
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.title20=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text20d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text20d1=§9이름:§0 루급 <br>§9함급:§0 BB<br>§9공장:§0 열수 소용돌이 / Ammo (800)<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Luck" in daytime<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Double/Triple Hit +5%%<br><br>Melee: deals 200%% firepower damage; Heavy attack: deals 20%%x5~10 torpedo damage (level-dependent).
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.title21=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text21d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text21d1=§9이름:§0 구축서희<br>§9함급:§0 서희급 DD<br>§9공장:§0 열수 소용돌이 / Grudge (500)<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Speed"&"Haste" to owner<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Pick up items<br><br>Chest armor and legs are just decorations, those great people do not understand it.
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.title22=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text22d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text22d1=§9이름:§0 중순서희<br>§9함급:§0 서희급 CA<br>§9공장:§0 열수 소용돌이 / Ammo (2000)<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Jump Boost"&"Speed" in night<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Cri/Double/Triple Hit +10%% in night<br><br>The two-tailed cat princess, the tails will pop up if you scratch her belly.
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.title23=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text23d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text23d1=§9이름:§0 이도서희<br>§9함급:§0 서희급 육상기지<br>§9공장:§0 열수 소용돌이 / Abyssium (2700)<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Poison" on attack<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>+"Blindness" on attack<br>Heavy attack uses gravity shell<br><br>The eccentric princess who rides a Cerulean has no friends, because all the friends have been eaten.
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.title24=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text24d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text24d1=§9이름:§0 중간서희<br>§9함급:§0 서희급 육상기지<br>§9공장:§0 열수 소용돌이 / Abyssium (4800)<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>소유자에게 Absirotion 효과 부여 and nearby ships<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Enhanced regeneration<br><br>Who lives in an abyssal puff under the sea?
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.title25=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text25d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text25d1=§9이름:§0 Submarine Princess<br>§9함급:§0 서희급 Submarine<br>§9공장:§0 열수 소용돌이 / Ammo (3500)<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>소유자에게 Invisibility 효과 부여<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Double torpedo<br>Pick up items<br>+"Invisibility"<br>SS base dodge 30%%<br><br>Her favorite things are thick and black torpedoes, and she likes to share (physically) her torpedo collection with others.
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.title26=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text26d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap4.text26d1=§9이름:§0 Submarine New Princess<br>§9함급:§0 서희급 Submarine<br>§9공장:§0 열수 소용돌이 / Ammo (2600)<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>소유자에게 Invisibility 효과 부여<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Double torpedo<br>Pick up items<br>+"Invisibility"<br>SS base dodge 35%%<br><br>She likes to play with Northern Princess and make trouble together all the time.

# GUI: Book Text Chap 5
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title=Enemy List
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title0=Kanmusu
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text0d0=Kanmusu is an aggressive evil ship, the biggest enemy of 심해서함.<br><br>If the owner stays in a water biome with a §d심해서함 Wedding Ring§0 in their inventory, the fleet of Kanmusu may appear on the sea nearby.
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text0d1=Defeating a fleet may reward the spawn egg of a Kanmusu. Register the Kanmusu by opening the ship inventory GUI.
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title1=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text1d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text1d1=§9이름:§0 시마카제<br>§9함급:§0 시마카제급 DD<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>소유자에게 Speed 효과 부여<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Pick up items<br><br>Heavy attack: Quintuple Oxygen Torpedo Mount: deal 30%% torpedo damage each torpedo.<br>Change the rensouhou summon type in appearance option.
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title2=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text2d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text2d1=§9이름:§0 나가토<br>§9함급:§0 나가토급 BB<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Strength" to nearby ships<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>+"Poison" on attack<br>Enhanced melee to 300%% firepower<br><br>Heavy attack: 91식 AP Fist: 4 round per attack, deal 400%% torpedo damage to main target and 200%% AoE attack.
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title3=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text3d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text3d1=§9이름:§0 U-511<br>§9함급:§0 Type IXC SS<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>소유자에게 Invisibility 효과 부여<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>+"Invisibility"<br>SS base dodge 30%%<br><br>Light attack: High Speed Torpedo, deals 100%% firepower damage.
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title4=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text4d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text4d1=§9이름:§0 Ro-500<br>§9함급:§0 Ro Series SS<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>소유자에게 Invisibility 효과 부여<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>+"Invisibility"<br>SS base dodge 35%%<br><br>Light attack: High Speed Torpedo, deals 100%% firepower damage.
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title5=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text5d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text5d1=§9이름:§0 야마토<br>§9함급:§0 야마토급 BB<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Resistance"&"Fire Resistance" to nearby ships<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>+"Mining Fatigue" on attack<br><br>Heavy attack: 야마토 Cannon: 2 round per attack, deals 150%% torpedo damage, beam maximum range ~ 120 blocks.
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title6=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text6d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text6d1=§9이름:§0 카가<br>§9함급:§0 카가급 CV<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Jump Boost" to nearby ships<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>+"Hunger" on attack<br><br>The aircraft carrier with a large wing of aircraft to make you feel fretful.
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title7=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text7d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text7d1=§9이름:§0 아카기<br>§9함급:§0 아카기급 CV<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Jump Boost" to nearby ships<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>+"Hunger" on attack<br><br>It's said that all 심해서함 will be eaten if 아카기 appears.
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title8=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text8d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text8d1=§9이름:§0 아카츠키<br>§9함급:§0 아카츠키급 DD<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>소유자에게 Haste 효과 부여<br>Built-in searchlight<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Pick up items<br><br>She is often seen in expedition with a heavy drum canister.
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title9=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text9d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text9d1=§9이름:§0 히비키<br>§9함급:§0 아카츠키급 DD<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Jump Boost" to owner<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Pick up items<br>Dodge +30%%<br><br>хорошо~
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title10=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text10d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text10d1=§9이름:§0 이카즈치<br>§9함급:§0 아카츠키급 DD<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>소유자에게 Strength 효과 부여<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Pick up items<br>Enhanced melee to 100%% firepower<br><br>The expedition leader with a very dangerous weapon in hand.
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title11=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text11d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text11d1=§9이름:§0 이나즈마<br>§9함급:§0 아카츠키급 DD<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>소유자에게 Speed 효과 부여<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Pick up items<br><br>Inazuma is the NANODEATH angel that can purify nearby shinkeiseikan, be careful!
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title12=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text12d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text12d1=§9이름:§0 텐류<br>§9함급:§0 텐류급 CL<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Night Vision" to owner<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Cri/Dodge +15%% in night<br>Enhanced melee to 200%% firepower<br><br>Her blade was enchanted with the Trayastrmsa devas' power and the dragon king of terror was sealed in her left eye. That's why she can use 텐류Slash.<br><br>Melee deal 100%% firepower damage, 텐류Slash deals 30%%x2~6 + 120%% torpedo damage (level-dependent).
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title13=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text13d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text13d1=§9이름:§0 타츠타<br>§9함급:§0 텐류급 CL<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Night Vision" to owner<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>Cri/Dodge +15%% in night<br>Enhanced melee to 200%% firepower<br><br>Lancer with E-Cups. She will riddle anyone (including master) close to 텐류 ...HOORAY♪<br><br>Melee deals 100%% firepower damage, 텐류Slash deals 50%%x1~3 + 150%% torpedo damage (level-dependent).
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title14=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text14d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text14d1=§9이름:§0 아타고<br>§9함급:§0 타카오급 CA<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>Heavy attacks use gravity shell<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>+"Slowness" on attack<br>Slow attacker on hit<br><br>She has the same level of chest armor as Harbour Princess. Small ships like DDs will become panpakapanly broken if they crash into her chest.
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title15=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text15d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text15d1=§9이름:§0 타카오<br>§9함급:§0 타카오급 CA<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>Heavy attacks use gravity shells<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>+"Slowness" on attack<br>Slow attacker on hit<br><br>Her huge mass of evil on the chest has been enough to produce significant gravity field to slow down nearby ships.
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title16=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text16d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text16d1=§9이름:§0 콩고<br>§9함급:§0 콩고급 BB<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Health Boost" to nearby ships<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>+"Weakness" on attack<br><br>Watch out for her BURNING LOOOOOOVE attack!
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title17=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text17d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text17d1=§9이름:§0 히에이<br>§9함급:§0 콩고급 BB<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Saturation" to nearby ships<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>+"Poison" on attack<br><br>Her cuisine can sink the enemies even allies!
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title18=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text18d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text18d1=§9이름:§0 하루나<br>§9함급:§0 콩고급 BB<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Luck" to nearby ships<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>+"Bad Luck" on attack<br><br>She seems to be a little angel but hides something dark...
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.title19=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text19d0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap5.text19d1=§9이름:§0 키리시마<br>§9함급:§0 콩고급 BB<br>§9오라 효과:§0<br>+"Night Vision" to nearby ships<br>§9기타 효과:§0<br>+"Blind" on attack<br>Enhanced melee to 150%% firepower<br><br>No problem cannot be solved (physically) with her brain.

# GUI: Book Text Chap 6
gui.shincolle:book.chap6.title=명령어
gui.shincolle:book.chap6.title0=
gui.shincolle:book.chap6.text0d0=§9/shipinfo§c<br>§dAuthority:§0 All Player<br>§dPurpose:§0 show ship info
gui.shincolle:book.chap6.text0d1=§9/shipchangeowner§c <Player Name><br>§dAuthority:§0 OP only<br>§dPurpose:§0 change ship's owner<br><br>OP, Ship and Player A must be online and in the same dimension (world).<br><br>The owner of the ship the OP's cursor is on will be changed to Player A.
gui.shincolle:book.chap6.title1=
gui.shincolle:book.chap6.text1d0=§9/shipupdateowneruid§3 [Player Name]<br>§dAuthority:§0 All Player<br>§dPurpose:§0 update ship's owner UID<br><br>If the ship does not respond, try this command to fix the bug. OP can specify a player to update the UID.<br><br>This command only affects the ships in the loaded chunk and the target player must be online.<br>If the command does not work, try /shipchangeowner to change ship's owner 1 by 1.
gui.shincolle:book.chap6.text1d1=§9/shipattrs <Ship LV> [<HP LV> <ATK LV> <DEF LV> <A.SPD LV> <M.SPD LV> <Range LV>]<br>§dAuthority:§0 OP only<br>§dPurpose:§0 change ship attributes<br><br>Change the level and six main attributes of the ship which the cursor is on. Valid value: Ship LV 
gui.shincolle:book.chap6.title2=
gui.shincolle:book.chap6.text2d0=§9/shipcleardrop [range]<br>§dAuthority:§0 OP only<br>§dPurpose:§0 remove drop item (grudge entity)<br><br>Remove drop item entity within range, default range 
gui.shincolle:book.chap6.text2d1=§9/shipemotes [emo]<br>§dAuthority:§0 All Player<br>§dPurpose:§0 Show emotes<br>§dAlias:§9/em, /emo, /emote, /emotes§0<br><br>Use the "tab" key to show the emotes list when typing.
gui.shincolle:book.chap6.title3=
gui.shincolle:book.chap6.text3d0=§9/shipstopai<br>§dAuthority:§0 OP only<br>§dPurpose:§0 stop ship AI<br><br>Stop all ship, hostile ship, ship mounts AI and update methods for emergencies like an entity dupe bug. 
